{
  "version": 1,
  "title": "Responsive empty state",
  "surface": "app",
  "modelLabel": "Lattice 3",
  "workspaceLabel": "fictional/daybreak-dashboard",
  "branchLabel": "feat/empty-state",
  "appearance": {
    "theme": "paper",
    "canvasWidth": 1080,
    "canvasHeight": 1350,
    "transparentCanvas": true,
    "terminalOpacity": 0.96,
    "background": "#e9e7e1",
    "accent": "#2f7d6d",
    "backdrop": "plain",
    "imageSkeleton": "dots",
    "shadowStrength": 0.5,
    "fontScale": 1.18,
    "chromeScale": 1.04
  },
  "chrome": {
    "contextPercent": 52,
    "clockTime": "11:05"
  },
  "display": {
    "headerIcons": true,
    "headerText": true,
    "composer": true,
    "footer": true,
    "productMark": true,
    "productVersion": true,
    "tuiGeometry": true
  },
  "timing": {
    "userTypingCps": 60,
    "agentTypingCps": 260,
    "thinkingMs": 1900,
    "toolRunMs": 1100,
    "imageGenMs": 3200,
    "permissionMs": 2100,
    "transitionMs": 240,
    "finalHoldMs": 1800
  },
  "pagination": {
    "flow": "slides",
    "messagesPerPage": 3,
    "scrollDistancePx": 0
  },
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "pricing-user-plan",
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Show me the empty-state proposal in three slides, for review."
    },
    {
      "id": "pricing-thinking",
      "role": "thinking",
      "content": "Splitting it along the decisions the review has to make"
    },
    {
      "id": "pricing-problem",
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "## 1 / The problem\n\nFirst run and a zero-result filter look the same.\n\n- The next step is not obvious\n- The wording is hard to read on mobile\n- The CTAs have no clear priority"
    },
    {
      "id": "pricing-user-frame",
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Let's settle the primary path.",
      "pageBreakBefore": true
    },
    {
      "id": "pricing-choice",
      "role": "choice",
      "content": "What should a first-run user be shown first?",
      "options": [
        "Create a report — the shortest path to value",
        "Browse templates — easier to choose from",
        "Import data — for people migrating"
      ],
      "chosenIndex": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "pricing-direction",
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "## 2 / The call\n\n**\"Create your first report\"** becomes the primary CTA.\n\nOn a zero-result filter it swaps to \"Clear filters\"."
    },
    {
      "id": "pricing-user-ship",
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Implement it that way.",
      "pageBreakBefore": true
    },
    {
      "id": "pricing-permission",
      "role": "permission",
      "content": "Edit EmptyState.tsx and its tests"
    },
    {
      "id": "pricing-done",
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "## 3 / Done\n\n```tsx\n<EmptyState action={<CreateReportButton />} />\n```\n\n- Wrapping checked at 360px\n- Keyboard operation checked\n- **6 tests green**"
    }
  ]
}
